# Contact form (Web3Forms) — https://web3forms.com
#
# 1. Go to web3forms.com, enter the email you want submissions sent to
# 2. Check that inbox for the access key
# 3. Add it in Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables
#    Name:  NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY
#    Value: <your access key>
# 4. Redeploy. The contact form appears once this is set.
#
# This key is public by design — it only allows sending to your own inbox.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
